# WP-DATA-LAYER-OUTLINER (UE Data Layer Outliner: SDataLayerBrowser, FDataLayerTreeItem / FDataLayerActorTreeItem;
# UDataLayerInstance Parent / bIsVisible / DebugColor; UDataLayerEditorSubsystem AddToActorEditorContext,
# AddActorsToDataLayers). WP format v4: a layer states Parent, DebugColor, InitiallyVisible.
# Layers: Gameplay > Enemies (Enemies.Parent = Gameplay) and Props; Props is made current, so the tree dropped into the
# viewport (the palette runs the viewport's own mesh drop at the view centre; DesertCtl has no drop-mesh verb) joins
# Props in its own creation step (Commands::SetCreatedEntitiesContext). The "barrels" are the three
# blocks of cell C11_10 of WP_Protocol (200513 "Main C11_10_B00", 200514 "..._B01", 200515 "..._B02"; WP_Protocol has
# no barrel mesh): DesertCtl `select` takes ONE entity, so each is selected and added in turn - the same verb a
# multi-selection runs once (DataLayerEditor::AddEntities over the selection's composites, one undo step).
# Hiding Enemies is the session's (not written): the blocks stay loaded and listed under Enemies (dimmed), not drawn
# (ECS::HiddenByDataLayersComponent, UE bHiddenEdLayer).
# Nothing is saved: the editor closes at the end with the world on disk as it was.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Дано run Panel "Open Data Layers"
Дано set world WorldPartition.DataLayers [{"Name":"Gameplay","InitiallyLoadedInEditor":true,"DebugColor":[0.85,0.35,0.30]},{"Name":"Enemies","InitiallyLoadedInEditor":true,"Parent":"Gameplay","DebugColor":[0.90,0.60,0.20]},{"Name":"Props","InitiallyLoadedInEditor":true,"DebugColor":[0.30,0.65,0.90]}]
Дано run Scene "Data Layers: Make Current Props"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 86000,4000,48000
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.35,1
Тогда dlo_before вид на ячейку C11_10: три блока 200513..200515 видны; в панели Data Layers дерево Gameplay > Enemies и Props, у Props отмечен Current и подпись "(current)", участников нет
Когда run Assets "Drop into the viewport: Environments/FieldBarn/Meshes/island_tree_02/island_tree_02.gltf"
Когда select 200513
Когда run Scene "Data Layers: Add Selected to Enemies"
Когда select 200514
Когда run Scene "Data Layers: Add Selected to Enemies"
Когда select 200515
Когда run Scene "Data Layers: Add Selected to Enemies"
Когда run Scene "Data Layers: Hide Enemies"
Тогда dlo_tree панель Data Layers - дерево Gameplay > Enemies (под Enemies три строки Main C11_10_B00/B01/B02, тусклые), Props (под ним новое дерево island_tree_02), Props помечен текущим (Current отмечен, "(current)"), у Enemies снят Visible; во вьюпорте трёх блоков нет, новое дерево стоит; в Outliner блоки есть (загружены, скрыты)
Тогда-вид dlo_tree_view тот же вид без панелей: блоков 200513..200515 нет, дерево на месте, остальная ячейка на месте
